    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "史臣曰：三代之隆，畿服有品，東漸西被，無遺遐荒。",
      "reading": "史臣述三代畿服等第、教化遠及。",
      "note": "史臣述三代畿服等第、教化遠及。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 24,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-24",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "及漢氏闢土，通譯四方，風教淺深，優劣已遠。",
      "reading": "轉論漢拓土通譯及風教深淺。",
      "note": "轉論漢拓土通譯及風教深淺。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 24,
      "end_codepoint": 45,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-45",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "晉室播遷，來宅揚、越，關、朔遙阻，隴、汧遐荒，區甸分其內外，山河判其表裏，而羌、戎雜合，久絕聲教，固宜待以荒服，羈縻而已也。",
      "reading": "以晉南渡後地勢分隔論荒服與羈縻。",
      "note": "以晉南渡後地勢分隔論荒服與羈縻。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 45,
      "end_codepoint": 107,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-107",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "若其懷道畏威，奉王受職，則通以書軌，班以王規。",
      "reading": "就奉職者論通書軌、班王規。",
      "note": "就奉職者論通書軌、班王規。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 107,
      "end_codepoint": 130,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-130",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "若負其岨遠，屈強邊垂，則距險閉關，禦其寇暴。",
      "reading": "論持險閉關。",
      "note": "論持險閉關。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 130,
      "end_codepoint": 152,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-152",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "桓溫一世英人，志移晉鼎，自非兵屈霸上，戰衂枋頭，則光宅之運，中年允集。",
      "reading": "以桓溫霸上與枋頭失利設想其晉鼎之志；霸上為數位校改。",
      "note": "以桓溫霸上與枋頭失利設想其晉鼎之志；霸上為數位校改。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 152,
      "end_codepoint": 187,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-187",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "高祖無周世累仁之基，欲力征以君四海，實須外積武功，以收天下人望。",
      "reading": "以劉裕世系與周代累仁之基相較，推論其須先立武功。",
      "note": "以劉裕世系與周代累仁之基相較，推論其須先立武功。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 187,
      "end_codepoint": 219,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-219",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "止欲挂斾龍門，折衝冀、趙，跨功桓氏，取高昔人，地未闢於東晉，威獨振於江南，然後可以變國情，愜民志，撫歸運而膺寶策。",
      "reading": "論北征爭望以備受禪的動機。",
      "note": "論北征爭望以備受禪的動機。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 219,
      "end_codepoint": 276,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-276",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "豈不知秦川不足供養，百二難以傳後哉！",
      "reading": "反問秦川不足供養、險地難傳。",
      "note": "反問秦川不足供養、險地難傳。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 276,
      "end_codepoint": 294,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-294",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "至舉咸陽而棄之，非失算也。",
      "reading": "作者稱棄咸陽並非失算。",
      "note": "作者稱棄咸陽並非失算。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 294,
      "end_codepoint": 307,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:received_sentence1-307",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "3qs_nqa_ioa_AAA",
      "source_quote": "此四將藉歸眾難固之情，已至於俱陷，為不幸矣。",
      "reading": "史臣以本卷四將俱陷結篇。",
      "note": "史臣以本卷四將俱陷結篇。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-048-shilun:p001",
